Chapter 33 - Building a Weekly Macro
Process
34.1 Learning objectives
You should be able to create a repeatable weekly fundamental workflow that separates facts, expectations,
scenarios and trade decisions.
34.2 The weekly macro sheet
For each currency you actively study, maintain:
